Nuked OPL3 1.8 - Nuke.YKT, (c) 2013-2020 - a cycle-accurate emulator of the YMF262 (OPL3),
made from die shots of the chip. emu816 uses it in OPL2 mode (the OPL3's NEW bit never set)
to make the sound of the board's YM3812 (opl.c).

Upstream:  https://github.com/nukeykt/Nuked-OPL3
